\ A module that borrows borrow_word_lib.1z's private helper and exposes it through a public word.
\ borrow_word.1z imports this module and asserts the borrowed private did not leak into this
\ module's public surface: `reveal` works, but `(greet-impl)` is not visible to an ordinary import.

borrow "borrow_word_lib.1z" ;

reveal: ( -- string ) [ (greet-impl) ] ;
